    "https://careers.pageuppeople.com/856/cw/en-us/job/498712/assistant-professor-marketing-and-sales": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor - Marketing and Sales",
      "description": "Assistant Professor - Marketing and Sales Apply now Job no: 498712 Location: Moon Campus Position Department: Marketing Position School: Rockwell School of Business Overview: The Rockwell School of Business at Robert Morris University (RMU) is accredited by the Association to Advance Collegiate Schools of Business (AACSB). The Department of Marketing is seeking qualified applicants with broad expertise in the fields of Marketing and Sales to teach in our graduate and undergraduate programs. The department proudly houses the Center for Sales Excellence, recognized by the University Sales Center Alliance (USCA). This vibrant hub drives student success through industry sponsorship and fields nationally competitive sales teams. Candidates with a teaching and research focus on professional sales, and an interest in coaching or expanding these initiatives, are highly encouraged to apply. Responsibilities: In addition to teaching in the school's graduate and undergraduate programs, the faculty is expected to conduct scholarly research in his/her discipline as well as provide service to the university community. Every teaching area in marketing will be considered. Minimum Qualifications: Candidates should have earned Ph.D. in Marketing from an AACSB accredited institution. Candidates who are ABD may be considered. Applicants must demonstrate excellence in teaching as well as productivity in research in their discipline. The successful candidate must be qualified as a Scholarly Academic as defined by Robert Morris University Rockwell School of Business. Act 153 Clearance Required: No Required To Pass a Motor Vehicle Report Check (If driving on behalf of the University): No Required to Pass a Credit Check: No Additional Posting Information: None Special Applicant Instructions: None Commitment to Diversity: RMU complies with all applicable federal, state and local laws and provides equal opportunity in all educational programs and activities, admission of students and conditions of employment for all qualified individuals regardless of race, color, sex, religion, age, disability, sexual orientation, or national origin. Reasonable Accommodation Notice: Federal law requires employers to provide reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. Please email humanresources@rmu.edu or call us at (412) 397-6270 if you require a reasonable accommodation to apply for a job or to perform your job. Advertised: July 30, 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
    },
    "https://careers.pageuppeople.com/856/cw/en-us/job/498665/parttime-facultydnp-psych-mental-health": {
      "title": "Part-Time Faculty-DNP Psych Mental Health",
      "description": "Part-Time Faculty-DNP Psych Mental Health Apply now Job no: 498665 Location: Moon Campus Position Title Part-Time Faculty-DNP Psych Mental Health Position Department DNP Nursing Program Position School School of Nursing and Health Sciences Overview Part-Time Faculty for the Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner DNP Program. Responsibilities Teach psychiatric mental health nurse practitioner courses, perform outcomes assessment at the course level and other levels as requested by the Nursing department head, and maintain attendance records. Minimum Qualifications Applicant must have a Master’s Degree in Nursing with an earned doctorate in Nursing or related field (or near completion) and certification as a PMHNP. Must possess current Pennsylvania license or eligibility for RN licensure in Pennsylvania. Past teaching experience preferred. Act 153 Clearance Required Yes Required To Pass a Motor Vehicle Report Check No Required to Pass a Credit Check No Additional Posting Information None Special Applicant Instructions None Advertised: July 15, 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
    },
    "https://careers.pageuppeople.com/856/cw/en-us/job/498666/parttime-facultydnp-site-adviser": {
      "title": "Part-Time Faculty-DNP Site Adviser",
      "description": "Part-Time Faculty-DNP Site Adviser Apply now Job no: 498666 Location: Moon Campus Position Department: DNP Nursing Program Position School: School of Nursing and Health Sciences Overview: Doctor of Nursing Practice (DNP) Site Adviser position will make visits to students in the clinical setting in collaboration with the lead course faculty member. Responsibilities: Responsibilities include visiting the assigned students at the clinical site; interacting and problem solving with the preceptor; communicating with the lead course faculty member and the students; supervising and grading of student paperwork including Subjective, Objective, Assessment and Plan (SOAP) note. Minimum Qualifications: Must be a licensed Nurse Practitioner; Doctor of Nursing Practice (DNP) is preferred but not required. Act 153 Clearance Required: Yes Required To Pass a Motor Vehicle Report Check: No Required to Pass a Credit Check: No Additional Posting Information: None Special Applicant Instructions: None Commitment to Diversity: RMU complies with all applicable federal, state and local laws and provides equal opportunity in all educational programs and activities, admission of students and conditions of employment for all qualified individuals regardless of race, color, sex, religion, age, disability, sexual orientation, or national origin. Reasonable Accommodation Notice: Federal law requires employers to provide reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. Please email humanresources@rmu.edu or call us at (412) 397-6270 if you require a reasonable accommodation to apply for a job or to perform your job. Advertised: July 15, 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
